message: "If you use ASRN, please cite it as below."
title: "ASRN: Adaptive Sparse Recurrence Network"
abstract: >-
  ASRN (Adaptive Sparse Recurrence Network) is a sequence-mixing layer for language models with learned-hash sparse
  retrieval of earlier occurrences, a learned proper-time clock and Hawkes repetition signals, with numerically
  protected Triton kernels.
